# Overlay Positioning Rules

## The stacking context trap — NEVER do this

`position: fixed` inside a CSS-transformed ancestor is positioned relative to that ancestor, NOT the viewport. Framer Motion's `motion.div` applies `transform` which creates a new stacking context.

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG — ScreenDemoLibrary was broken this way for months
// ShellIdentityBar renders a <motion.div> with transform
// ShellSystemControls is a child of ShellIdentityBar
// ScreenDemoLibrary with fixed inset-0 gets TRAPPED in the header
function ShellSystemControls() {
  const [showLibrary, setShowLibrary] = useState(false);
  return (
    <>
      <button onClick={() => setShowLibrary(true)}>Open</button>
      {showLibrary && <ScreenDemoLibrary />} {/* fixed inset-0 TRAPPED in header */}
    </>
  );
}
```

## REQUIRED — all full-viewport overlays render from App.tsx root

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT — overlay renders at root level, outside all transforms
// In App.tsx:
{mode === 'demo_library' && (
  <motion.div className="fixed inset-0 z-[var(--z-shell-system-controls)] ...">
    <ScreenDemoLibrary onClose={() => setMode('voice')} />
  </motion.div>
)}

// In ShellSystemControls — fire a prop callback, never mount overlays directly:
function ShellSystemControls({ onOpenDemoLibrary }: { onOpenDemoLibrary?: () => void }) {
  return <button onClick={onOpenDemoLibrary}>AI Library</button>;
}
```

## Centered overlay pattern (not dropdown)

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT — centered OS overlay
className="fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/55 backdrop-blur-[2px] z-[var(--z-shell-modal-backdrop)]"

// ❌ WRONG — dropdown from corner (not an OS-style overlay)
className="fixed right-3 top-[calc(var(--shell-header-height)+0.5rem)] w-[26rem]"
```

## Components that MUST NOT mount full-viewport overlays

- `ShellSystemControls` — fires prop callbacks instead
- `ShellIdentityBar` — fires prop callbacks instead  
- `CommandRail` — fires prop callbacks instead
- Any component inside a `motion.div` with animation transforms

All `fixed inset-0` overlays must be direct children of the root `<div>` in `App.tsx` or `main.tsx`.
